{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/standard-odcs-3.2.0--affacf92/document.md", "ordinal": 21, "selector": "web://8d7e212202a4164f#B21", "text_preview": "The sections above contain example values. We carefully reviewed the consistency of those values, but we cannot guarantee that there are no errors. If you spot one, please raise an issue ."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/standard-odcs-3.2.0--affacf92/document.md", "ordinal": 22, "selector": "web://8d7e212202a4164f#B22", "text_preview": "Some fields have a null value: even if it is equivalent to not having the field in the contract, we wanted to have the field for illustration purposes."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/standard-odcs-3.2.0--affacf92/document.md", "ordinal": 23, "selector": "web://8d7e212202a4164f#B23", "text_preview": "The contract should be platform agnostic . If you think this is not the case, please raise an issue ."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/standard-odcs-3.2.0--affacf92/document.md", "ordinal": 24, "selector": "web://8d7e212202a4164f#B24", "text_preview": "The provided JSON schemas are companions to the standards (ODCS or ODPS), it means that they do not define the standards and may include bugs. In case of conflict between the standard and the JSON Schema, the standard takes precedence."}
